🌍 Real-World Example

email = "greshma@gmail.com"

if email.endswith("@gmail.com"):
    print("Valid Gmail Address")
else:
    print("Invalid Email")

Output

Valid Gmail Address

🧠 Key Learning

upper() → Converts text to uppercase.

lower() → Converts text to lowercase.

strip() → Removes extra spaces.

replace() → Replaces text.

split() → Converts a string into a list.

join() → Joins list elements into a string.

find() → Returns the position of a substring.

count() → Counts occurrences of a substring.

startswith() → Checks the beginning of a string.

endswith() → Checks the end of a string.


 